    fix(test): http.test.ts pidfile race — poll before asserting existence (INT-CI-027)
    
    CI run 37693553960 failed on the concurrent-instances pidfile existence
    check while it passes locally: /health answering does not guarantee the
    daemon has written its pidfile yet. Add waitForPidFile polling before
    the asserts in both DOGFOOD-008 tests.
    
